    "title": "'The Book of Mormon' shows canceled through May 17 after fire damages theater - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago\nPerformances of \"The Book of Mormon\" have been canceled through Sunday, May 17, after a fire damaged Broadway's Eugene O'Neill Theatre on Monday.\nThe flames were reported around 10 a.m. Monday at the theater on West 49th Street.\nThe fire was limited to the followspot booth. The cause of the fire has not been determined.\n\"The Book of Mormon\" and ATG Entertainment released a statement saying ticket holders for impacted performances will be notified via their point of purchase to receive refunds or reschedule options.\nSubmit a tip or story idea to Eyewitness News Have a breaking news tip or an idea for a story we should cover? Send it to Eyewitness News using the form below. If attaching a video or photo, terms of use apply.",
